WEBVTT

00:01:13.129 --> 00:01:13.546
<v><b>C:</b></v> Ben.

00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:16.348
Can you put those boxes in the back room, please?

00:01:17.785 --> 00:01:18.462
<v><b>B:</b></v> Of course.

00:01:34.374 --> 00:01:37.509
<v><b>C:</b></v> What are you doing after work? Do you have any plans?

00:01:38.494 --> 00:01:39.072
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t know.

00:01:39.478 --> 00:01:42.488
I think I’ll probably go for a run with Izzy.

00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:50.676
<v><b>C:</b></v> Are you OK?

00:01:51.384 --> 00:01:53.431
<v><b>B:</b></v> Ah! I hurt my back.

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:56.233
That box was a little heavier than I thought.

00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:57.566
<v><b>C:</b></v> Here.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:58.228
Sit down.

00:02:07.119 --> 00:02:07.921
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’ll be fine.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:09.280
Ah!

00:02:09.327 --> 00:02:09.822
<v><b>C:</b></v> OK.

00:02:10.197 --> 00:02:11.480
I think you need to go home.

00:02:11.994 --> 00:02:13.588
I can finish everything here.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.061
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I think I’ll be OK.

00:02:16.119 --> 00:02:17.046
Ah!

00:02:17.066 --> 00:02:18.097
<v><b>C:</b></v> I’ll get you a cab.

00:02:45.629 --> 00:02:46.317
<v><b>I:</b></v> Hey, Ben.

00:02:47.374 --> 00:02:48.171
Quick question.

00:02:48.483 --> 00:02:50.624
Are we still going for a run after work?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.775
<v><b>B:</b></v> Uh…well…

00:02:55.254 --> 00:02:58.593
<v><b>I:</b></v> Because I mentioned it to Max and he wants to come with us.

00:02:58.947 --> 00:03:00.442
You remember Max, right?

00:03:01.301 --> 00:03:01.744
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:03:02.697 --> 00:03:03.244
I do.

00:03:04.889 --> 00:03:06.165
<v><b>I:</b></v> So are you coming?

00:03:09.853 --> 00:03:11.759
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, I’m coming.

00:03:12.816 --> 00:03:13.566
See you later.

00:03:14.624 --> 00:03:15.426
<v><b>I:</b></v> See you later.